      "author": "@claude",
      "content": "Implemented stdin TTY guard for task patch: if --data is absent and input is interactive (process.stdin.isTTY or KSPEC_TEST_TTY), command now exits immediately with validation error instead of waiting on stdin. Also treats empty stdin as no patch data. Added integration regressions for piped-stdin success and interactive/no-data fast-fail; verified with npm run build, npx vitest run tests/integration.test.ts -t \"Integration: task patch\", and npx vitest run tests/batch-exec-engine.test.ts."
    }
